  "description": "The meme carries a potentially harmful undertone by implying that the only way to cope with the trauma of bomb disposal is to 'pray' or seek spiritual solace, which may inadvertently minimize the psychological and emotional toll of the job or suggest that the work is so overwhelming that only divine intervention can help. This framing could be seen as harmful because it potentially romanticizes or spiritualizes the trauma, rather than acknowledging the professional, psychological, and societal support systems needed for those in such high-risk roles.",
